+** filesystem supports doing multiple write operations atomically when those
+** write operations are bracketed by [SQLITE_FCNTL_BEGIN_ATOMIC_WRITE] and
+** [SQLITE_FCNTL_COMMIT_ATOMIC_WRITE].
